{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27261","headline":"送陈校书赴蔡州幕 · 章孝标","name":"送陈校书赴蔡州幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天假纵横入幕筹，东南顿减一方忧。\n行賷健笔辞天阁，坐见妖星落蔡州。\n青草袍襟翻日脚，黄金马镫照旄头。\n此行领取从军乐，莫虑功名不拜侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27261.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27261","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}